{"3433600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Space Sim Tycoon", "steam_appid": 3433600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>UPDATES</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed a bug with money not displaying properly. Now money/upkeep is shown on each ship and updates on the bottom left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added the ability to edit your lines by clicking on the number to the left of the station</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added the ability to rename your stations by editing the textbox of the corresponding station</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/94a090ddb61f077e694faf6503c880ce.poster.avif?t=1763873834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/94a090ddb61f077e694faf6503c880ce.webm?t=1763873834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/94a090ddb61f077e694faf6503c880ce.mp4?t=1763873834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/8d87d8471786add90a774445095ccbe3.avif?t=1763873834\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Suns and Systems per Map</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Passenger Stations and Passenger Ships</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terraforming Planets</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/7b5e55ba8056a4cd6e82d341f942b040.avif?t=1763873834\" width=1000 height=563 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spaceship Tycoon game set in the wild west of space.  A trading, crafting, and business simulation in space. Build up colonies and set up new mining ventures to extract foreign untapped resources from many celestial bodies. A sandbox game that is procedurally generated with a seed. The player sets up space stations, factories, mining operations, and is also responsible for the transportation of goods and commodities. Explore different planets, suns, and blackholes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/090bb885717cf2f466d32e03af074485.avif?t=1763873834\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/70b6b4280ca1af3f921a4baee90ac38c.poster.avif?t=1763873834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/70b6b4280ca1af3f921a4baee90ac38c.webm?t=1763873834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/70b6b4280ca1af3f921a4baee90ac38c.mp4?t=1763873834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build Factories and Mining Outposts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/bdccf0d10bc091f745f72db3d929b5fc.poster.avif?t=1763873834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/bdccf0d10bc091f745f72db3d929b5fc.webm?t=1763873834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/bdccf0d10bc091f745f72db3d929b5fc.mp4?t=1763873834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build factories and set up mining outposts to transfer resources and products for profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Establish Shipping Lanes and Routes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/f686e1ca5a0385c6d31039059b19a07b.poster.avif?t=1763873834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/f686e1ca5a0385c6d31039059b19a07b.webm?t=1763873834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/f686e1ca5a0385c6d31039059b19a07b.mp4?t=1763873834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish routes from mining operations to factories and from factories to cities all in 3D space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build Ships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/82b5bc2b2de55ab2a5de7b0be471fc1b.poster.avif?t=1763873834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/82b5bc2b2de55ab2a5de7b0be471fc1b.webm?t=1763873834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/82b5bc2b2de55ab2a5de7b0be471fc1b.mp4?t=1763873834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build ships to carry your resources from your mining operation, to the factories, and finally arriving at the cities for profit. All in classic transportation tycoon style.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spaceship Tycoon game set in the wild west of space.  A trading, crafting, and business simulation in space. Build up colonies and set up new mining ventures to extract foreign untapped resources from many celestial bodies. A sandbox game that is procedurally generated with a seed. The player sets up space stations, factories, mining operations, and is also responsible for the transportation of goods and commodities. Explore different planets, suns, and blackholes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/090bb885717cf2f466d32e03af074485.avif?t=1763873834\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/70b6b4280ca1af3f921a4baee90ac38c.poster.avif?t=1763873834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/70b6b4280ca1af3f921a4baee90ac38c.webm?t=1763873834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/70b6b4280ca1af3f921a4baee90ac38c.mp4?t=1763873834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build Factories and Mining Outposts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/bdccf0d10bc091f745f72db3d929b5fc.poster.avif?t=1763873834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/bdccf0d10bc091f745f72db3d929b5fc.webm?t=1763873834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/bdccf0d10bc091f745f72db3d929b5fc.mp4?t=1763873834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build factories and set up mining outposts to transfer resources and products for profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Establish Shipping Lanes and Routes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/f686e1ca5a0385c6d31039059b19a07b.poster.avif?t=1763873834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/f686e1ca5a0385c6d31039059b19a07b.webm?t=1763873834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/f686e1ca5a0385c6d31039059b19a07b.mp4?t=1763873834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish routes from mining operations to factories and from factories to cities all in 3D space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build Ships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/82b5bc2b2de55ab2a5de7b0be471fc1b.poster.avif?t=1763873834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/82b5bc2b2de55ab2a5de7b0be471fc1b.webm?t=1763873834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/extras/82b5bc2b2de55ab2a5de7b0be471fc1b.mp4?t=1763873834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build ships to carry your resources from your mining operation, to the factories, and finally arriving at the cities for profit. All in classic transportation tycoon style.</p>", "short_description": "Space Sim Tycoon – A sandbox transportation tycoon game where you can explore forbidden planets, gather resources, craft goods, and establish routes to manage your space empire.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/e446216b0ce1e186bb4a36dce37cfc44192578b0/header.jpg?t=1763873834", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/4883632a30db0d23bb8c512908a9ec20ff359189/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763873834", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433600/4883632a30db0d23bb8c512908a9ec20ff359189/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763873834", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-1135G7<br></li>